{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48957","headline":"八月十六夜月 · 卢延让","name":"八月十六夜月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十六胜三五，中天照大荒。\n秪讹些子缘，应号没多光。\n桂老犹全在，蟾深未煞忙。\n难期一年事，到晓泥诗章。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢延让","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48957.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48957","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}